  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d8/Starry_Gift.png/revision/latest?cb=20251219213738\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Starry Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Starry Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Starry Gift</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 17</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>holly</span><span title=\"Holly\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"holly\"><img alt=\"holly\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b8/Holly.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20221206145759\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>10</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  10m</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 71</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Gift Wrapping Station</span><span title=\"Gift wrapping station\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/gift-wrapping-station-35675\" title=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 10</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Starry Gift</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 17. It's a special item used only for the Christmas 2025 event.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making Starry Gift</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/47/Gift_Wrapping_Station.png/revision/latest?cb=20221206151201\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Gift Wrapping Station</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Starry gift are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/gift-wrapping-station-35675\" title=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gift Wrapping Station</a>.\n</p><p>To make a starry gift in 2025, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/indigo-2083\" title=\"Indigo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Indigo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/milk-2141\" title=\"Mink\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mink\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/carrot-pie-2089\" title=\"Carrot pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Carrot pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 10 minutes to make a gift. Each gift gives players 71 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p><p>Additionally, Starry gift is used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/polka-dot-gift-36299\" title=\"Polka dot gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Polka dot gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/polka-dot-gift-36299\" title=\"Polka Dot Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Polka Dot Gift</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d8/Starry_Gift.png/revision/latest?cb=20251219213738\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Starry Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 50\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 to 2 gifts per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat. Each candy used on a boat will be rewarded with 10 <a href=\"/wiki/holly-35688\" title=\"Holly\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hollys</a>, 11 hollys in a 1-star, 14 hollys in a 2-star, and 20 hollys in a 3-star.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831215711\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 916/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3646/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 65/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 766244/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   65.825      1 -total\n 76.25%   50.192      1 Template:Infobox\n 32.07%   21.110      6 Template:Infoicon\n 10.52%    6.922      1 Template:Navigation\n  5.64%    3.712      1 Template:Item_Usage\n  3.85%    2.534      3 Template:Clr\n  3.12%    2.053      1 Template:Languages\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36479-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831215711 and revision id 108971. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
